            <Title>RFE/RL Uzbek News Text Corpus</Title>
            <Description>This dataset serves as a comprehensive longitudinal news corpus for the Uzbek language, sourced from Radio Ozodlik (ozodlik.org), the Uzbek service of Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty (RFE/RL). Spanning from January 2002 to March 2026, the corpus contains 166,316 unique articles, totaling over 31 million tokens. The dataset captures the historical record and linguistic evolution of the region over nearly a quarter-century. The file is formatted as plain text with YAML front-matter metadata, making it ready for linguistic analysis, search indexing, and cultural preservation research.</Description>
